cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below, and note the protocol version embedded in each run file you used."
title: "LocalMode Bench Open Data: Community-Submitted Benchmark Runs of In-Browser AI Inference"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Juady"
    given-names: "Muath"
repository-code: "https://github.com/LocalMode-AI/LocalMode-Bench"
url: "https://localmode.ai/bench"
license: CC0-1.0
date-released: 2026-09-18
keywords:
  - benchmark
  - browser
  - WebGPU
  - WebAssembly
  - LLM
  - embeddings
  - on-device AI
  - crowdsourced
abstract: >-
  Community-submitted benchmark runs measuring LLM and embedding inference
  across browser AI runtimes (WebLLM, wllama, Transformers.js, LiteRT,
  Chrome Built-in AI, MediaPipe) on real consumer devices, under the
  versioned LocalMode Bench protocol (each run file records the protocol
  version it was measured under; localmode-bench/4 is current). Each run
  contains raw per-chunk timing traces, a full environment capture, and a
  SHA-256 digest, so all published statistics are independently
  recomputable.
